DVWA Security Lab Report
Overview

This lab demonstrates practical exploitation of web application vulnerabilities using DVWA (Damn Vulnerable Web Application) deployed in a Docker container.
The objective is to understand how common vulnerabilities behave under different security configurations and how defensive mechanisms affect exploitation attempts.

The vulnerabilities tested in this lab include:
SQL Injection
Command Injection
xss reflected
xss stored

Each vulnerability was tested at the following DVWA security levels:
Low
Medium
High

